menu "WireGuard"

    config WIREGUARD_MAX_PEERS
        int "Maximum number of peers"
        default 1
        help
            The ESP only talks to the VPS, so 1 is enough.

    config WIREGUARD_MAX_SRC_IPS
        int "Allowed IPs per peer"
        default 6
        help
            Every AllowedIPs takes a slot. esp_wireguard_init() itself spends
            one on the address of the ESP, so with the original value (1) the
            tunnel network did not fit and esp_wireguard_add_allowed_ip()
            failed.

endmenu
